{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game design, art, and sound pay tribute to the great 8-bit era games! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern game engines breathe new life into classics: smooth animations, multi-layered scrolling backgrounds, modern pacing! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable, chill capybara brothers and brave animal friends! A vivid arch-villain! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stomp enemies! Hurl them away! Rescue animal friends! Team up with them! Find hidden levels! Defeat evil bosses! Core mechanics are easy to pick up, but challenges abound! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level design subtly guides you to master all mechanics! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through levels, your skills sharpen! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-path level design lets newbies enjoy the flow and veterans savor thrilling platforming! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthearted story packed with humor! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op mode! Relive the joy of battling alongside friends! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun mode! Prove you\u2019re still the ultimate 8-bit gamer! </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051320?t=1760433582","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051320?t=1760433582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051320/cf3e01a81fb764188abf79d93f9d163b6d7e952f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760433582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051320/cf3e01a81fb764188abf79d93f9d163b6d7e952f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760433582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"S